{%if stinger.properties | length > 0 %}## Properties

Properties are values held by the server.  They are re-published when the value changes.  Each property holds exactly one value, but that value can be an array or a struct.

```plantuml
@startuml
Server -> Server : Set Property
Client <<- Server: Property Updated
@enduml
```
